          "code": "// Blink + Serial Monitor\nconst int LED = 13;   // D13 = LED L บนบอร์ด\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(LED, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(LED, HIGH);\n  Serial.println(\"LED ON\");\n  delay(500);\n  digitalWrite(LED, LOW);\n  Serial.println(\"LED OFF\");\n  delay(500);\n}\n",
